<title>HONG KONG: Central Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</title>
<headline>Central Banking Corp sets US$50 mln FRCD.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1996-09-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following issue was</p>
<p>announced by Sumitomo Finance Asia.</p>
<p> BORROWER CENTRAL BANKING CORP		 GUARANTOR   - -</p>
<p> AMT	US$50 MLN   COUPON    6ML+45     MATURITY    364 DAYS</p>
<p> TYPE     FRCD	  ISS PRICE PAR	  LAUNCHED    16.SEP.96</p>
<p> PUTS     NONE	  CALLS     NONE	 REPLIES     --</p>
<p> LISTING  NONE	  REPAYMENT BULLET     DENOMS	US$500K</p>
<p> RATINGS  --	    SALE LMTS --	   PAY DATE    OCT 96</p>
<p> NEG PLG  --	    CRS DEF   --	   FORCE MAJ   --</p>
<p> GOV LAW  ENGLISH     HOME CTRY S.KOREA    TAX PROV    NA</p>
<p>MGT LEVELS AND FEES  CO-LEADS  US$4-5 MLN 8 BP ALL-IN 53</p>
<p>			    MANAGERS  US$2-3 MLN 5 BP ALL-IN 50</p>
<p>ARRANGER  ING BARINGS, SUMITOMO FINANCE ASIA (BOOKS)</p>
<p>CO-ARGRS  DEVELOPMENT BANK OF SINGAPORE, WESTLB ASIA PACIFIC</p>
<p> NOTES     CENTRAL BANKING CORP WAS FORMERLY KNOWN AS CENTRAL</p>
<p>	     INVESTMENT AND FINANCE CORP. IT OBTAINED A MERCHANT</p>
<p>	     BANKING LICENCE IN JULY 1996.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843-6371</p>
